# Component-level connections (wires)
MainGenerator-->PowerSensor[resource]@power
PowerSensor-->MainController[data]@data
MainController-->MainGenerator[signal]@control
TankSensor-->MainController[data]@data
MainController-->MainPump[signal]@control
MainPump-->WaterTank[resource]@water

# Station-level connections (roads)
StationA<-->StationB[signal]@road

# Block-level connections (hallways)
BlockA1<-->BlockA2[signal]@hallway
BlockB1<-->BlockB2[signal]@hallway
